cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OCT and visual field report extraction and validation pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic OCR pipeline that extracts 54 visual-field points and OCT
  GCIPL/RNFL metrics from real-world JPG clinical reports, with a cell-wise
  validation protocol scoring accuracy against a manual-review reference and a
  remediability-based error taxonomy. Research code accompanying the manuscript;
  raw clinical data are not included (IRB restriction).
